          : "In the conditional London scenario MED 40 / OPT 80, the original-weight total is 57. Moving five weight points from MED to OPT yields 59, reversing the order against Singapore's 58 under those weights. This is a sensitivity exercise, not newly established evidence; official weights remain unchanged."
      }
    </p>
    <p>
      {
        zh
          ? "洛杉矶形成 PCS 条件性 40，ISR／MED／LON／TEC／OPT 条件性 60，GSS／RES 未定；无总分中心，数学域 42—67。旧灾害失效与已完成的恢复、告警和培训对读，PCS 40 仍须接受保护瓶颈延续的假设。实际现场试验和区域理赔支持有限临床路径推定；拟议十人试点与预期商业供应不算已治疗，登记地址不归属给 UCLA 或 Cedars。当前监测、居民负担、延续和全区适用仍须假设，拒绝即撤回。四个近似参考点不验证完整边界或治疗地点。"
          : "Los Angeles has conditional PCS 40 and ISR/MED/LON/TEC/OPT 60, with GSS/RES unresolved: no total centre and a mathematical domain of 42–67. Historical disaster failures are read alongside completed restoration, alerts and training; PCS 40 still assumes a persistent protection bottleneck. Actual on-site trials and regional claims support only a limited clinical-pathway inference. A proposed ten-person pilot and expected commercial availability are not treated patients; registered addresses are not attributed to UCLA or Cedars. Current monitoring, resident affordability, continuity and area-wide applicability remain assumptions; rejecting them withdraws judgments. Four approximate reference points establish neither complete boundaries nor treatment sites."
      }
    </p>
    <p>
      {
        zh
          ? "源名 Osaka [Kyoto] 是一个功能区，六维条件性 60，GSS／MED 未定；无总分中心，数学域 42—72。实际供给、防护和数字使用与未完成备援／触达共同判读。急诊及专科确有交付，但单院术前抗菌药时点指标的定义、抽取和影响未解决；不假定异常无害保留 MED 60，也不当作全区感染率给 40。原始两病例支持实际有限给药／监测，不证明居民疗效或普遍获得；iPSC 人体试验、附条件批准与计划 Phase 4 分开，未确认首例不记零。七个近似点不验证完整边界或实际治疗地点。"
          : "Osaka [Kyoto] is one candidate area, with six conditional 60 judgments and GSS/MED unresolved: no total centre and a mathematical domain of 42–72. Actual supply, protection and digital use are reviewed alongside incomplete backup and reach. Emergency and specialist care is delivered, but a hospital's preoperative antibiotic timing metric has unresolved definitions, extraction and impacts; its anomaly is neither assumed harmless to retain MED 60 nor treated as an area-wide infection rate to assign 40. Two primary cases support limited actual drug administration/monitoring, not population efficacy or general access. iPSC human trials, conditional approval and planned Phase 4 remain distinct; an unconfirmed first transplant is not zero delivery. Seven approximate points establish neither complete boundaries nor actual treatment sites."
      }
