        zh
          ? "加沙功能区由全候选历史信号确定调查优先级，再核验截止日前 WHO 与 OCHA 当前证据。PCS 条件性 40，GSS、RES、MED 各 20；ISR、LON、TEC、OPT 未定，无总分。正在运行的医院、援助和转运与严重约束一并判读；没有测速样本不记低分。固定四项判断后的数学域为 14—59，撤回 MED 假设则为 11—71，均不是可靠排除界限。地带范围的资料不能冒充加沙市实测；功能区适配仍未完成。"
          : "Gaza's research priority follows a historical signal in the full candidate universe, then current WHO and OCHA evidence published before the cutoff. PCS is conditionally 40; GSS, RES and MED are 20. ISR, LON, TEC and OPT remain unresolved, with no total. Operating hospitals, aid and evacuations are retained alongside serious constraints; absent network samples receive no low score. Fixing the four judgments gives a mathematical domain of 14–59; withdrawing the MED assumption gives 11–71. Neither is a reliable exclusion bound. Strip-level evidence is not a Gaza municipality measurement; FUA adaptation remains unresolved."
      }
